# Vercel deploys

Hobby blocks GitHub pushes from `abezul-thefuture`. After any git push that should go live, create the production deployment with the Vercel CLI/API while logged in as **nexterraholdings** (do not wait for the GitHub webhook).

- Admin production: project `sterlingadmin` (https://admin.sterlingtheapp.com), git `nexterraholdings/sterling-admin`
- Also deploy twin project `sterling-admin` when shipping that repo
- Landing production: project `frontendlandingsterling` (https://sterlingtheapp.com), git `nexterraholdings/sterlinglanding`

Do not import the repo into a new Vercel account. Do not treat a blocked GitHub deploy as success.
